<title>USA: Noland Aug sales fall 9 pct to $41.6 mln.</title>
<headline>Noland Aug sales fall 9 pct to $41.6 mln.</headline>
<dateline>NEWPORT NEWS, Va 1996-09-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Noland Co said Monday it had sales totaling $41.6 million in August, 9.0 percent less than the $45.7 million registered for the same month last year.  </p>
<p>Noland said sales reached $316.9 million during the first eight months of the year, 0.8 percent less than the $319.5 million for the same period in 1995.</p>
<p>Noland is a wholesale distributor of plumbing, heating and air conditioning products.</p>
